Here is a list of common units related to electromagnetism:<ref>{{Cite web |title=Essentials of the SI: Base & derived units |url=https://physics.nist.gov/cuu/Units/units.html |access-date=2022-08-22 |website=physics.nist.gov |date=12 April 2010 |archive-date=2020-12-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201228002022/https://physics.nist.gov/cuu/Units/units.html |url-status=live }}</ref>
